    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<b>MOVE & MERGE</b>

    Swipe in any direction. Matching tiles merge
    once per move. Reach your board''s target.


    <b>YOUR TOOLS</b>

    Unlock
    after 2 valid moves. Undo reverses the last action. Swap two different adjacent
    occupied tiles. Delete removes one tile. Cancel spends nothing.


    <b>EARN
    MORE</b>

    After use, hold 128 / 256 / 512 to earn Undo / Swap / Delete on
    valid moves. Cooldown: 1 second. Lifetime cap: 4 / 5 / 6 per board.


    <b>ONE
    MORE CHANCE</b>

    One continuation rewinds up to 5 actions and keeps your
    score.'
